### Product Catalog API Requests
# Use this file to test product endpoints in IntelliJ IDEA or VS Code REST Client.

@host = http://localhost:8080
@productId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@productV2Id = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222
@categoryId = 44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444

### 0. Login as Seeded Catalog User (200 OK)
POST {{host}}/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "catalog",
  "password": "catalog1234"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("catalogAccessToken", response.body.accessToken);
%}

### 1. Create Product (201 Created)
POST {{host}}/v1/products
Authorization: Bearer {{catalogAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{productId}}",
  "sku": "PROD-SAMPLE-001",
  "name": "Ergonomic Mechanical Keyboard",
  "description": "Customizable mechanical keyboard with silent tactile switches",
  "priceInCents": 12999,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### 2. Retrieve Product by Identifier (200 OK)
GET {{host}}/v1/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{catalogAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 3. Update Existing Product (200 OK)
PUT {{host}}/v1/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{catalogAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "PROD-SAMPLE-001",
  "name": "Ergonomic Mechanical Keyboard Pro",
  "description": "Updated model with wireless connectivity and aluminum chassis",
  "priceInCents": 14999,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### 4. List Active Products (200 OK)
GET {{host}}/v1/products?limit=10&offset=0&status=ACTIVE
Authorization: Bearer {{catalogAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 5. Create Product - Validation Error (400 Bad Request)
POST {{host}}/v1/products
Authorization: Bearer {{catalogAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "sku": "PROD-INVALID",
  "name": "",
  "description": "Invalid product with blank name and negative price",
  "priceInCents": -500,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### 6. Create Product - Conflict Error (409 Conflict)
POST {{host}}/v1/products
Authorization: Bearer {{catalogAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{productId}}",
  "sku": "PROD-SAMPLE-001",
  "name": "Duplicate Keyboard",
  "description": "Attempt to create product with existing identifier and SKU",
  "priceInCents": 9999,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### 7. Retrieve Non-Existent Product (404 Not Found)
GET {{host}}/v1/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{catalogAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 8. Delete Product (204 No Content)
DELETE {{host}}/v1/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{catalogAccessToken}}

### 9. Create Product v2 with Required Category (201 Created)
# Create the category in categories.http first.
POST {{host}}/v2/products
Authorization: Bearer {{catalogAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{productV2Id}}",
  "sku": "PROD-V2-001",
  "name": "Wireless Mechanical Keyboard",
  "description": "Low-profile mechanical keyboard assigned to the Keyboards category",
  "priceInCents": 15999,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}"
}

### 10. Retrieve Product v2 with Resolved Discounts (200 OK)
# Read endpoints evaluate active campaigns at request time and return matching discounts.
GET {{host}}/v2/products/{{productV2Id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{catalogAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 11. Update Product v2 (200 OK)
PUT {{host}}/v2/products/{{productV2Id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{catalogAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "PROD-V2-001",
  "name": "Wireless Mechanical Keyboard Pro",
  "description": "Updated wireless model assigned to a valid category",
  "priceInCents": 17999,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}"
}

### 12. List Products v2 with Resolved Discounts (200 OK)
GET {{host}}/v2/products?status=ACTIVE&sort=name&direction=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{catalogAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 13. Create Product v2 - Unknown Category (400 Bad Request)
POST {{host}}/v2/products
Authorization: Bearer {{catalogAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222223",
  "sku": "PROD-V2-UNKNOWN-CAT",
  "name": "Invalid Category Keyboard",
  "description": "Fails because the category identifier does not exist",
  "priceInCents": 9999,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "categoryId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### 14. Create Product v2 - Missing Category (400 Bad Request)
POST {{host}}/v2/products
Authorization: Bearer {{catalogAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222224",
  "sku": "PROD-V2-NO-CAT",
  "name": "Missing Category Keyboard",
  "description": "Fails because v2 requires categoryId",
  "priceInCents": 9999,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### 15. Delete Product v2 (204 No Content)
DELETE {{host}}/v2/products/{{productV2Id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{catalogAccessToken}}


